            { "speaker": "sheep", "expression": "annoyed", "text": "The other half, he sends me in first. If that lantern starts talking, I am not the one answering it." },
            { "speaker": "owl", "expression": "neutral", "text": "Hold still, both of you. That lantern burns from the far side of the wall, so somebody in the next reality lit it for us. Whoever they are, they are expecting company, and they are not a patient host." }
